<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Neyemi Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Neyemi a Fe Taruxuna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Neyemi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Neyemi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Neyemi a Fe Taruxuna</para>
  <para style="ip">Neyemi findi Yahudiyana nde nan na Esirasi a waxatini. Muxu dinaxin nan yi Neyemi ra. Perisene mangan naxan xili Aratasɛrɛkɛsi, na kuntigi kɛndɛna nde nan yi Neyemi ra. Neyemi mangan mafan nɛn alogo a xa tin a siga Yerusalɛn taani alogo a xa sa feene yitɔn lan a konna siga feen ma yɛɛn na. A to na li, hali yaxuna ndee to yi katama e xa a yɛɛ rati, a kon kaan muxu wuyaxi a mali nɛn. E yi Yerusalɛn taan nabilinna yinna ti. Neyemi mɔn yi Esirasi mali dina sali gbeena nde yi, Esirasi Alaa sariya kitabun xaran naxan yi. Lewine yi lu a yɛbɛ yamaan xa alogo e xa a famu, nayi e yi e sɔbɛ so Alaa fe yi. Neyemi yi yamanan dɔxɔ kiina nde yɛba. A yi taan nabilinna yinna ti sɛwa sanla raba, a mɔn yi yamaan nakɔta sariyan suxu kiin ma.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Neyemi Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1"/>Xakaliyaa dii xɛmɛn Neyemi a falane.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 1:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">Kisilewi kiken na, Aratasɛrɛkɛsi a mangayaan ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛdeni, n yi Suse manga taani. <verse eid="NEH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2"/>Ngaxakedenna Xanani nun muxuna ndee yi fa sa keli Yuda yi. N yi e maxɔdin Yahudiyane fe ma, yaxune naxanye suxu, e siga e ra konyiyani, e ɲɛɲɛne mɔn yi xɛtɛ Yerusalɛn yi, e nun lan Yerusalɛn ma fe ma. <verse eid="NEH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3"/>E yi n yabi, e naxa, “Suxu muxun naxanye lu e nii ra, na ndee bata fa dɔxɔ Yuda yamanani, koni e yigitɛgɛxi, e yagixi. Yerusalɛn taan nabilinna yinne yirena ndee bata bira, tɛɛn yi taan so dɛɛne birin gan.”<verse eid="NEH 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4"/>N to na falane mɛ, n yi dɔxɔ, n wuga, n yi sunu xi wuyaxi, n yi sun, n yi Ala maxandi, Ala Naxan Kore, <verse eid="NEH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5"/>n naxa, “Alatala, Ala Naxan Kore, naxan gbo, a magaxu, i tan naxan i ya layirin nun i ya hinanna luma i xanuntenne xa naxanye i ya yamarine suxuma, <verse eid="NEH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6"/>i tuli mati, i yi i yɛɛn ti n na, i yi i ya walikɛna maxandi xuiin namɛ. N ni i maxandima waxatini ito yi i ya walikɛne xa, Isirayila kaane, kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na, n yi n ti Isirayila kaane yulubine ra bayo nxu bata yulubin liga i ra nxu nun n ma denbayana, nxu bata yulubin liga. <verse eid="NEH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7"/>Nxu bata fe ɲaxin liga i ra, nxu mi i ya yamarine nun i ya tɔnne nun i ya sariyane suxi i naxanye so i ya walikɛɛn Musa yii. <verse eid="NEH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8"/>I ya falana fe xa rabira i ma, i naxan so i ya walikɛɛn Musa yii, i naxa, ‘Ɛ na tinxintareyaan naba waxatin naxan yi, n na ɛ raxuyama ayi nɛn siyane yɛ. <verse eid="NEH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9"/>Koni, xa ɛ xɛtɛ n ma, xa ɛ n ma yamarine suxu, ɛ yi e liga, nayi, hali ɛ sa bɔxɔ xɔnna danna ra, n sa fama ɛ ra nɛn yireni n dɛnaxan sugandixi alogo n xinla xa lu na.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.9</char> Na feen sɛbɛxi Sariyane 30.1-5 kui.</note> <verse eid="NEH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10"/>I ya walikɛne nun i ya yamaan nan e ra, i naxanye xunbaxi i sɛnbɛ gbeeni. <verse eid="NEH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11"/>Marigina, i tuli mati n tan, i ya walikɛna maxandi xuiin na, e nun i ya walikɛɛn naxanye sɛwaxi gaxuma i xinla yɛɛ ra! N ma feene rasɔnɔya to, n tan i ya walikɛna, i yi a liga xɛmɛni ito xa kininkinin n ma n na siga a yɛtagi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Na waxatini, n tan nan yi yengi saxi mangan minseene xɔn ma.<verse eid="NEH 1:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Neyemi Yerusalɛn yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1"/>Nisan kiken na, Aratasɛrɛkɛsi a mangayaan ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛdeni, manpaan yi dɔxi mangan yɛtagi, n yi a tongo, n yi a so mangan yii. N yi sunuxi a yɛtagi, naxan ɲɔxɔn munma yi liga n na singen. <verse eid="NEH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2"/>Mangan yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “I yɛtagini fɔrɔxi nanfera? Anu, i mi furaxi. Waxatina nde bɔɲɛ rafɔrɛn ni ito ra.” N yi gaxu han, <verse eid="NEH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3"/>koni n yi mangan yabi, n naxa, “Mangan xa lu a nii ra habadan! N yɛtagini fɔrɔxi nɛn bayo n benbane gaburune sa taan naxan yi, mɛnna birin bata halagi, tɛɛn yi na taan so dɛɛne birin gan.” <verse eid="NEH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4"/>Mangan yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “Nanse xɔli i ma, n xa a liga i xa?” N yi Ala maxandi naxan kore, <verse eid="NEH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5"/>n yi mangan yabi, n naxa, “Xa mangan tin, xa n tan i ya walikɛɛn nafan i ma, n nasiga Yuda yamanani. N benbane gaburune sa taan naxan yi, n mɔn xa sa na ti.” <verse eid="NEH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6"/>Mangana ɲaxanla yi dɔxi a fɛma, mangan yi n maxɔdin, a naxa, “I ya sigatiin buma han waxatin mundun yi, i xɛtɛn waxatin mundun yi?” Mangan yi tin n xa siga, nayi n yi n xɛtɛ waxatin fala a xa. <verse eid="NEH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7"/>N mɔn yi a fala mangan xa, n naxa, “Xa mangan tinɲɛ, a xa kɛdine so n yii siga Efirati baan sogegododen binna yamana kanne ma, alogo e xa a lu n dangu siga han Yuda yi, <verse eid="NEH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8"/>i mɔn yi kɛdi keden so n yii Asafi xa, naxan mangana fɔtɔnne kantanma, alogo a xa xalanbe wudine so n yii, n sa yire makantanxin dɛɛne ti Ala Batu Banxin dɛxɔn, e nun taan yinne nun n sa luma banxin naxan kui.” Mangan yi ne so n yii, bayo Ala yi n xɔn.<verse eid="NEH 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9"/>N yi siga yamana kanne fɛma naxanye yi Efirati baan sogegododen binni, n yi mangana kɛdin so e yii. Mangan bata yi sofa kuntigine nun soo ragine bira n fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="NEH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10"/>Sanbalata, Horoni kaan nun Amonina nde Tobiya, a walikɛɛn to na mɛ, e yi xɔlɔ kati a nanfera muxuna nde fama a fa Isirayila kaane mali.<verse eid="NEH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Neyemi yi yinne mato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11"/>N yi so Yerusalɛn yi, n yi xi saxan ti na. <verse eid="NEH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12"/>Nayi, nxu nun muxuna ndee yi keli kɔɛɛn na, n mi a fala muxe xa n ma Ala bata yi naxan yita n na a n xa a liga Yerusalɛn xa. N keden peen nan yi dɔxi sofanla fari. <verse eid="NEH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13"/>N yi mini Lanbanna so dɛɛn na kɔɛ tagini siga Sube Magaxuxi Tigin nun Ɲɛɲɛ dɛɛn binna ra, n yi lu Yerusalɛn taan nabilinna yinne matoɛ. N yi taan yinna to kalaxi, a yire wuyaxi yi biraxi, tɛɛn bata yi dɛɛne gan nun. <verse eid="NEH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14"/>N yi dangu Tigin so dɛɛn nun mangana ige ramaraden dɛxɔn, koni n ma soon mi a dangude sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NEH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15"/>N yi te xuden xɔn kɔɛɛn na, n siga taan yinne matoɛ Kedirɔn lanbanna binni. Na xanbi ra, n mɔn yi so Lanbanna so dɛɛn na, n xɛtɛ na kii nin.<verse eid="NEH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16"/>Taan kuntigine mi yi a kolon n yi sigaxi dɛnaxan yi e nun n yi naxan ligama. Han na waxatini, n munma yi sese fala Yahudiyane nun saraxaraline nun taa kanne nun kuntigine nun tide kan gbɛtɛye xa. <verse eid="NEH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17"/>Nayi, n yi a fala e xa, n naxa, “Ɛ bata a to en tɔrɔn naxan yi iki! Yerusalɛn bata kala, tɛɛn bata a so dɛɛne gan! Ɛ fa, en fa Yerusalɛn taan nabilinna yinne ti. Nayi, en mi fa yagima sɔnɔn.” <verse eid="NEH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18"/>N yi a yɛba e xa Ala n mali kii naxan yi, e nun mangan falan naxan ti n xa. E yi a fala, e naxa, “En siga, en sa taan ti!” Nayi, e yi e bode sɛnbɛ so na wali faɲina fe yi.<verse eid="NEH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19"/>Horoni kaan Sanbalata nun Amonin Tobiya a kuntigin nun Arabun Gesen to na mɛ, e yi nxu magele, e yi nxu raɲaxu. E yi a fala, e naxa, “Ɛ nanse ligama ito ra? Ɛ murutɛma mangan nan xili ma ba?” <verse eid="NEH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20"/>N yi e yabi, n naxa, “Ala nɔɔn fima nɛn nxu ma, Ala Naxan Kore. Nxu tan, a walikɛne, nxu kelima nɛn, nxu yi a ti. Koni ɛ tan, ɛ mi kɛɛ sɔtɔn taani ito yi, ɛ mi sariya sɛ be, ɛ fe mi fa rabirama muxe ma Yerusalɛn taani!”<verse eid="NEH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn yinne yitɔnna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1"/>Saraxarali kuntigina Eliyasibi nun a ngaxakeden saraxaraline yi keli walideni. E mɔn yi Yɛxɛɛne So Dɛni tɔn. E yi a rasariɲan, e yi a dɛɛne ti a ma. E yi taan yinna ti siga han sangansoon naxan yi xili Kɛmɛ, e yi na rasariɲan. E mɔn yi taan yinna ti siga han Xananɛli Sangansona. <verse eid="NEH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2"/>Yeriko kaane fan yi walima mɛnna dɛxɔn, e nun Sakuru, Yimiri a dii xɛmɛna. <verse eid="NEH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3"/>Sena kaane yi taan so dɛni tɔn dɛnaxan xili Yɛxɛ So Dɛna. E dɛ wudine ti, e dɛɛne sa e ma e nun e balan wurene. <verse eid="NEH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4"/>Yuriyaa dii xɛmɛn Meremoti fan yi walima na yiren dɛxɔn, Hakɔsi mamandenna. Bereki a dii xɛmɛn Mesulan fan yi walima na yiren dɛxɔn Mesesabele mamandenna, e nun Banahaa dii xɛmɛn Sadɔki. <verse eid="NEH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5"/>Tekowa taan muxune fan yi walima na dɛxɔn ma. Anu, taan muxu gbeene tondi walɛ nɛn walikɛ kuntigine yamarin bun.<verse eid="NEH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6"/>Yoyadaa dii xɛmɛn Paseya nun Besodiyaa dii xɛmɛn Mesulan yi Dɛ Fonni tɔn. E yi a dɛɛn wudine ti, e yi a balan wurene sa. <verse eid="NEH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7"/>Gabayon kaan Melatiya fan yi yinna yirena nde yitɔnma na dɛxɔn ma, e nun Meronoti kaan Yadon nun Gabayon kaa gbɛtɛye nun Misipa kaane. E birin yi walima yamana kanna nan bun Efirati baan sogegododen binni. <verse eid="NEH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8"/>Xarahaa dii xɛmɛn Yusiyɛli fan yi yinna yirena nde yitɔnma na dɛxɔn e nun Xananiya, latikɔnɔn nafalana nde.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:8">E yi siga walɛ han Yerusalɛn yinna yigbo yirena. <verse eid="NEH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9"/>Xuru a dii xɛmɛn Rɛfaya fan yi yirena nde yitɔnma na dɛxɔn, Yerusalɛn bɔxɔn fɔxɔ kedenna yirena nde kuntigina. <verse eid="NEH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10"/>Xarumafaa dii xɛmɛn Yɛdaya fan yi walima a banxin yɛtagi, Xasabaneyaa dii xɛmɛn Xatusi fan yi yinna yirena nde yitɔnma na dɛxɔn. <verse eid="NEH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11"/>Xarimi a dii xɛmɛn Malakiya nun Paxata-Moyabaa dii xɛmɛn Xasubu fan yi walima yire gbɛtɛye yi siga han sangansoon naxan xili Buru Gandena. <verse eid="NEH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12"/>Haloxesi a dii xɛmɛn Salun nun a dii tɛmɛne fan yi yinna yirena nde yitɔnma na dɛxɔn, Yerusalɛn bɔxɔn fɔxɔ kedenna yirena nde kuntigina.<verse eid="NEH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13"/>Xanun nun Sanowa kaane yi Lanbanna So Dɛni tɔn. E yi a dɛɛn wudine ti, e yi a balan wurene sa. E mɔn yi nɔngɔnna yɛ wuli keden fan yitɔn taan yinni, siga han Xuruse Ɲɛɲɛ Dɛna. <verse eid="NEH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14"/>Rekabu a dii xɛmɛn Malakiya, Beti-Hakeremi kuntigin yi Xuruse Ɲɛɲɛ Dɛni tɔn. A yi a dɛɛn wudine ti, a yi a balan wurene sa. <verse eid="NEH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15"/>Kola-Xose a dii xɛmɛn Salun, Misipa kuntigin yi Tigi Dɛni tɔn, a yi a ti, a yi a xunna soon so a xun na, a yi a dɛɛn wudine ti, a yi a balan wurene sa. A mɔn yi taan yinni tɔn Selaxa ige ramaraden dɛxɔn, dɛnaxan mangana nakɔɔn fɛma, siga han tedene, dɛnaxan sigama Dawudaa Taani.<verse eid="NEH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16"/>Dɔnxɛn na, Asabuku a dii xɛmɛn Neyemi, Beti-Suru fɔxɔ kedenna kanna yi siga yinni tɔnɲɛ Dawudaa gaburun binni siga han ige malanden binna, siga han mangana sofane banxina. <verse eid="NEH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17"/>A xanbi ra, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yi walima Bani a dii xɛmɛn Rexun bun ma. Hasabi, Keyila fɔxɔ kedenna kuntigin fan yi taan yinni tɔnma a dingirani. <verse eid="NEH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18"/>A ngaxakedenne fan yi walima a xanbi ra, Xenadadaa dii xɛmɛn Bawayi, Keyila fɔxɔ kedenna bonna kuntigin bun. <verse eid="NEH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19"/>Misipa kuntigin Yosuwe a dii xɛmɛna Eseri fan yi yire gbɛtɛ yitɔn, keli yɛngɛ so seene malan banxin yɛtagi, siga han dɛnaxan xili Songenna.<verse eid="NEH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20"/>Sabayi a dii xɛmɛn Baruku fan yi yire gbɛtɛ yitɔn a xanbi ra, keli Songenna ma siga han saraxarali kuntigina Eliyasibi a banxin dɛ ra. <verse eid="NEH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21"/>Yuriyaa dii xɛmɛn Meremoti, Hakɔsi mamandenna fan yi yire gbɛtɛ yitɔn a xanbi ra, keli Eliyasibi a banxin so dɛɛn ma siga han a danna. <verse eid="NEH 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22"/>Saraxaraliin naxanye sa keli Yerusalɛn rabilinne yi, ne fan yi walima mɛn xanbi ra. <verse eid="NEH 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23"/>Ne fan xanbi ra, Bunyamin nun Xasubu yi walima mɛnni e banxine yɛtagi. Ananiyaa dii xɛmɛn Maaseyaa dii xɛmɛna Asari fan yi walima mɛnni ne xanbi ra a banxin dɛxɔn ma. <verse eid="NEH 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24"/>Xenadadaa dii xɛmɛn Binuwi fan yi yire gbɛtɛ yitɔn na xanbi ra, keli Asari a banxin ma siga han yinna songenna nde.<verse eid="NEH 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25"/>Yusayi a dii xɛmɛn Palala fan yi walima na yinna songenna yɛtagi e nun sanganso kuyen manga banxin yɛtagi kantan tiine sansanna dɛxɔn. Parosi a dii xɛmɛn Pɛdaya fan yi walima a xanbi ra. <verse eid="NEH 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26"/>Ala Batu Banxin walikɛɛn naxanye yi dɔxi Ofɛli geyaan ma, ne fan yi siga yinni tɔnɲɛ han sangansoon songenna ma, dɛɛn naxan xili Ige So Dɛna sogegododen binni. <verse eid="NEH 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27"/>Tekowa kaane fan yi yinna yire gbɛtɛ yitɔn ne xanbi ra, keli sangansoon songenna ma siga han Ofɛli yinna.<verse eid="NEH 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28"/>Dɛɛn naxan yi xili Soona, saraxaraline fan yi walima na faxan na e banxine yɛtagi. <verse eid="NEH 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29"/>Imeri a dii xɛmɛn Sadɔki yi walima e xanbi ra a banxin yɛtagi. A xanbi ra, Sɛkani a dii xɛmɛn Semaya fan yi walima mɛnni, naxan yi dɛɛn kantanma naxan yi xili Sogeteden So Dɛna. <verse eid="NEH 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30"/>E xanbi ra, Selemiyaa dii xɛmɛn Xananiya nun Salafaa dii xɛmɛn senninden Xanun yi mɛnni, ne fan yi yire gbɛtɛ yitɔn yinna ma. Bereki a dii xɛmɛn Mesulan fan yi ne xanbi ra, a banxin yɛtagi.<verse eid="NEH 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31"/>A xanbi ra, xɛma wanla Malakiya fan yi walima mɛnni, siga han Ala Batu Banxin walikɛne nun yulane banxina Mifikadi dɛɛn yɛtagi, siga han sangansoon naxan sa yinna songenna ma. <verse eid="NEH 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32"/>Xɛma wanla bonne nun yulane fan yi yinni tɔn keli sangansoon songenna ma siga han Yɛxɛɛne So Dɛna.<verse eid="NEH 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaxune yi wa wanla kala feni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 3:33"/>Sanbalata to a mɛ a nxu mɔn yinna tima, a yi xɔlɔ han! A yi Yahudiyane magele. <verse eid="NEH 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 3:34"/>A yi a fala a ngaxakedenne nun Samari kaa sofane yɛɛ xɔri, a naxa, “Yahudiya fangatareni itoe nanse ligama? En tinɲɛ e xa na liga ba? E nɔɛ saraxan bɛ ba? E a raɲanɲɛ to ba? E mɔn nɔɛ gɛmɛ maluxunxine raminɛ ba naxanye bɛndɛn nun se ganxine bun ma?” <verse eid="NEH 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 3:35"/>Amonina nde Tobiya yi a dɛxɔn ma, na yi a fala, a naxa, “Hali e ti, xa xulumasena nde sigan ti a fari, e gɛmɛ yinna birin kalama nɛn!”<verse eid="NEH 3:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 3:36"/>Nayi, n yi Ala maxandi, n naxa, “Nxɔ Ala, i tuli mati nxu ra, amasɔtɔ nxu yaxune bata nxu raɲaxu! I marayarabin naxɛtɛ e ma, i yi e rasiga konyiyani. <verse eid="NEH 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 3:37"/>I nama diɲa e hakɛne ma, e yulubine nama ba i yɛtagi, amasɔtɔ e bata yinna ti muxune makonbi.”<verse eid="NEH 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 3:38"/>Nxu yinni tɔn na kii nin han a yiteyaan tagi taan nabilinni. Yamaan yi na wanla suxu e sɔbɛɛn na.<verse eid="NEH 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1"/>Koni, Sanbalata nun Tobiya nun Arabune nun Amonine nun Asadodi kaane to a mɛ a Yerusalɛn rabilinna yinna ti feen sigama yɛɛn na, e nun a muxune bata yi a yire biraxine yitɔn fɔlɔ, e yi xɔlɔ kati. <verse eid="NEH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2"/>E lan a ma a e birin xa sa Yerusalɛn yɛngɛ, e na kala.<verse eid="NEH 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3"/>Nayi, nxu bata nxɔ Ala maxandi, nxu yi kantan tiine dɔxɔ kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na alogo e xa nxu ratanga e ma. <verse eid="NEH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4"/>Anu, Yuda kaane yi a falama nɛn, e naxa, “Nxɔ walikɛne sɛnbɛn bata ɲan, gɛmɛ biraxine maxali daxin mɔn gbo, nxu mi nɔɛ yinna tiyɛ.” <verse eid="NEH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5"/>Nxu yaxune yi a falama nɛn, e naxa, “Yahudiyane mi a kolonɲɛ, e mi a famunɲɛ han en yi so e tagi, en yi e faxa, en yi e wanli kala.” <verse eid="NEH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6"/>Anu, Yahudiyan naxanye yi dɔxi nxu yaxune rabilinni, ne fa nɛn, e fa nxu rakolon na feen ma han dɔxɔɲa ma fu, e naxa, “E fa en yɛngɛma nɛn sa keli yiren birin yi.” <verse eid="NEH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7"/>Nanara, n yi muxuna ndee dɔxɔ yinna xanbirane yi dɛnaxanye so ɲaxun, n yi yamanan muxune dɔxɔ bɔnsɔn yɛɛn ma, e silanfanne nun tanbane nun xanle ra e yii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.7</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> <verse eid="NEH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8"/>N to e ti kiin mato, n yi falan ti taan fonne nun kitisane xa e nun yamaan naxan birin yi na, n naxa, “Ɛ nama gaxu en yaxune yɛɛ ra. A xa rabira ɛ ma fa fala Marigin sɛnbɛn gbo, a magaxu. Ɛ yɛngɛn so ɛ ngaxakedenne nun ɛ dii xɛmɛne nun ɛ dii tɛmɛne nun ɛ ɲaxanle nun ɛ dɔxɔdene xa.”<verse eid="NEH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9"/>Nxu yaxune yi a mɛ fa fala nxu bata rakolon, a Ala bata e fe nataxin kala. Nxu birin yi xɛtɛ yinni, birin yi sa a wanla dɛ suxu. <verse eid="NEH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10"/>Keli na lɔxɔn ma, n ma walikɛne fɔxɔ kedenna nan yi fa walima, fɔxɔ kedenna yi tanbane nun yɛ masansan wure lefane nun silanfanne nun xanle suxu e yii, e yi e tagi xidi. Kuntigine yi Yuda kaane birin makantanma, <verse eid="NEH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11"/>naxanye yi yinna tima. Naxanye yi goronne maxalima hanma, e yi goronne kui sa, ne yi walima e yii kedenne nan na, e yi yɛngɛ so seen suxu e yii kedenna ra. <verse eid="NEH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12"/>Naxanye yi a tima, ne birin ma silanfanne yi xidixi e tagi nɛn, e yi walima na kii nin. Xɛmɛn naxan yi xɔtaan fema, na yi biraxi n fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="NEH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13"/>N yi a fala fonne nun kitisane nun yamaan dɔnxɛn xa, n naxa, “Wanla gbo, wulani kuya, en bata xuya ayi yinna xuntagi, en bata masiga en bode ra. <verse eid="NEH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14"/>Ɛ nɛma dɛdɛ, xa ɛ xɔtaan fe xuiin mɛ, ɛ malan nxu fɛma. En ma Ala yɛngɛn soma nɛn en xa.” <verse eid="NEH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15"/>Nxu siga wanla ma na kii nin, tanban suxi yamaan fɔxɔ kedenna yii keli subaxan ma han sarene yi mini kore. <verse eid="NEH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16"/>Na waxatini, n mɔn yi a fala yamaan xa, n naxa, “Xɛmɛne birin xa xi Yerusalɛn yi e nun a walikɛna, en kantanna ti kɔɛɛn na, en yi wali yanyin na.” <verse eid="NEH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17"/>Nxu mi yi nxɔ dugine bama mumɛ, n tan ba, ngaxakedenne ba, n ma walikɛne ba, muxun naxanye yi n kantanma ba, birin ma yɛngɛ so seen nun a min igen nan tun yi suxi a yii.<verse eid="NEH 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Neyemi yi yiigelitɔne mali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1"/>Lɔxɔna nde, yamanan xɛmɛna ndee nun e ɲaxanle yi e mawuga e ngaxakeden Yahudiyane fari, <verse eid="NEH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2"/>ndee naxa, “Nxu nun nxɔ dii xɛmɛne nun nxɔ dii tɛmɛne wuya. Nxu wama nɛn nxu xa balon sɔtɔ alogo nxu xa nxu dɛge, nxu lu nxu nii ra.” <verse eid="NEH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3"/>Ndee fan yi a fala, e naxa, “Nxu bata nxɔ xɛɛne nun nxɔ manpa binle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wudi binla nde na yi, mɛn kaane naxanye sima, e yi naxanye bogi yitɔnma alo manpana e gbee kiini.</char></note> nun nxɔ banxine dɔxɔ tolimani alogo nxu xa balon sɔtɔ fitina kamɛni.” <verse eid="NEH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4"/>Gbɛtɛye fan naxa, “Nxu bata gbetin tongo donla ra nxɔ xɛɛne nun nxɔ manpa binle xun yi, alogo nxu xa mudun fi naxan lan a so mangan yii. <verse eid="NEH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5"/>Anu, nxu nun nxu ngaxakedenne birin keden, nxɔ dii xɛmɛne luxi nɛn alo e gbeene, koni a mato nxu nxɔ dii xɛmɛne nun nxɔ dii tɛmɛne matima konyine ra, nxɔ dii tɛmɛ wuyaxiye bata findi konyine ra, nafulu mi nxu yii, nxɔ xɛɛne nun nxɔ manpa binle mɔn bata findi muxu gbɛtɛye gbeen na.”<verse eid="NEH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6"/>N to e mawuga xuiin mɛ, n yi xɔlɔ han! <verse eid="NEH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7"/>N yi a ragidi n xa taan muxu gbeene nun kitisane maxadi, n yi a fala e xa, n naxa, “Ɛ tɔnɔn fenma ɛ ngaxakedenne ra nanfera!” N yi malan gbeen maxili e fe ra. <verse eid="NEH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8"/>N mɔn yi a fala e xa, n naxa, “En bata en ngaxakeden Yahudiyane xun ba, naxanye yi saraxi siya gbɛtɛne xɔn konyine ra. Iki, ɛ tan yɛtɛɛn nan fa ɛ ngaxakeden Yahudiyane matima e Yahudiya bodene ma.” E mi fala sɔtɔ e naxan tiyɛ, e yi e dundu. <verse eid="NEH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9"/>N mɔn yi a fala, n naxa, “Ɛ naxan ligama, na mi fan. Ɛ mi nɔɛ sigan tiyɛ Ala yɛɛ ra yi gaxuni ba, alogo siya gbɛtɛye nama en nayelefu, en yaxune? <verse eid="NEH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10"/>N tan fan nun ngaxakedenne nun n ma walikɛne, nxu fan muxune doli nɛn gbetin nun donseni. Nayi, e lanma e xa naxan naxɛtɛ, en nama na maxili. <verse eid="NEH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11"/>Ɛ sa e xɛɛne raxɛtɛ e ma to yɛtɛni, e nun e manpa binle nun e oliwi binle nun e banxine. Ɛ nama tɔnɔ maxili e ra gbetin nun murutun nun minseen nun turen fari.” <verse eid="NEH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12"/>E yi yabin ti, e naxa, “Nxu e raxɛtɛma e ma nɛn, nxu mi fa sese maxɔdinma e ma, i naxan falaxi nxu na liga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:12">Nayi, n yi saraxaraline xili, alogo e xa e kɔlɔ e yɛɛ xɔri. <verse eid="NEH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13"/>Na xanbi ra, n yi n ma doma gbeen lenbeni maxa, n yi a fala, n naxa, “Ala xa muxune birin yimaxa na kiini naxanye na e fala xuiin kala, a yi e bɔnɔ e denbayane nun e seene yi, alogo e yiigenla xa lu!” Yamaan birin yi Alatala tantun, e yi sɔnxɔ, e naxa, “Ala xa na liga, amina!” Dɔnxɛn na, yamaan yi a falan suxu.<verse eid="NEH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14"/>Xabu n dɔxɔ lɔxɔni yamana kanna ra Yahudiyane xun na Yuda yamanani, xabu Manga Aratasɛrɛkɛsi a mangayaan ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛdena han ɲɛɛ tonge saxan e nun firindena, n tan nun ngaxakedenne nxu mi sese ba mudun na naxan soma yamana kanna yii. <verse eid="NEH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15"/>Yamana kanna naxanye dangu n tan yɛɛ ra, ne yi donseene nun manpane rasuxuma nɛn yamaan na e nun gbeti gbanan tonge naanin. Hali yamana kanne xɔyine yi yamaan tɔrɔma. Koni, n tan to yi gaxuxi Ala yɛɛ ra, n mi na sifan liga. <verse eid="NEH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16"/>Koni, n tan yɛtɛɛn wali nɛn taan yinna tideni, n mi xɛɛ yo sara n yɛtɛ xa, anu n ma walikɛne birin yi yinna tiin fari. <verse eid="NEH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17"/>Anu, muxu kɛmɛ tonge suulun nan yi e dɛgema n konni Yahudiyane nun kuntigine yɛ, ba muxune ra naxanye yi fama sa keli yamanan nabilinna siya gbɛtɛne yɛ. <verse eid="NEH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18"/>Ɲinge keden nun yɛxɛɛ yɛbaxi sennin nan yi faxama n xa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ e nun tɔxɛna ndee. Xi fu yo xi fu, manpa faɲi gbegbe yi rafalama n xa nɛn. Koni, hali na, n mi mudun maxili n tan yamana kanna xa, bayo wanla yi xɔdɔxɔ yamaan ma.<verse eid="NEH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19"/>N ma Ala, n ma fe xa rabira i ma, i fan n na bayo n bata wali faɲin kɛ yamaan xa.<verse eid="NEH 5:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yaxune mɔn yi fa e xili ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1"/>Sanbalata nun Tobiya nun Arabun Gesen nun nxu yaxun bonne yi a mɛ a n mɔn bata taan yinna ti, a dɛdɛ mi fa kalaxi. Na waxatini, n munma yi dɛɛne ti singen. <verse eid="NEH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2"/>Sanbalata nun Gesen yi xɛrane rafa a faladeni n xa, e naxa, “Fa en fa en bode to Kefirimi yi Ono lanbanni.” E bata yi a ragidi a e xa fe ɲaxin liga n na. <verse eid="NEH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3"/>Koni, n yi e yabi, n naxa, “Wanla n yii han! N mi nɔɛ sigɛ. Nanfera wanla xa rati be, n siga ɛ fɛma?” <verse eid="NEH 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4"/>E na xɛraan nafa n ma dɔxɔɲa ma naanin, n fan yi e yabi na kii kedenni. <verse eid="NEH 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5"/>Sanbalata mɔn yi a walikɛɛn nasiga na fala kedenna ra a suulundeni, kɛdi rabixin yi suxi naxan yi. <verse eid="NEH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6"/>Ito nan yi sɛbɛxi a kui, a naxa, “Siya gbɛtɛne ito nan falama, anu Gesen fan a falama, a ɲɔndin na a ra, e naxa a i tan nun i ngaxakeden Yahudiyane waxi murutɛ feni. I taan yinna tima na nan ma. A luxi alo i waxi findi feni Yahudiyane mangan nan na. <verse eid="NEH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7"/>I yɛtɛɛn bata nabine dɔxɔ alogo e xa i ya fe fala Yerusalɛn yi fa fala a i bata findi mangan na Yuda yi. Perise mangan mi buma na mɛdeni. Nayi, fa en fa batu.” <verse eid="NEH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8"/>N yi a yabi, n naxa, “Muxe mi na falane tima. Ɲɔndi mi i ya falane ra! I tan nan tun ne mirixi, i yi e fala!” <verse eid="NEH 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9"/>Na muxune birin yi wama nxu ragaxu feen nin, e naxa, “E sɛnbɛn ɲanma nɛn, e mi wanla raɲanma.” Koni, n yi Ala maxandi, n naxa, “Ala, iki, n sɛnbɛ so.”<verse eid="NEH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10"/>N yi siga Dɛlayaa dii xɛmɛn Semaya konni, Mehetabeli mamandenna, bayo a mi yi nɔɛ fɛ n konni. A yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “En birin xa siga Yire Sariɲanxini Ala Batu Banxin kui, en sa a dɛɛne balan en xun ma, amasɔtɔ i yaxune fama nɛn i xili ma, e fama kɔɛɛn nan na i faxadeni.” <verse eid="NEH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11"/>N yi a yabi, n naxa, “Na muxu mi n tan na naxan a gima! N tan muxu sifan nɔɛ soɛ Ala Batu Banxini ba, n lu n nii ra? N mi soma Ala Batu Banxini n luxundeni!” <verse eid="NEH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12"/>N yi a kolon fa fala a mi yi Alaa falan xan nalima n ma. Koni, a yi na falama n xa nɛn, amasɔtɔ Sanbalata nun Tobiya bata yi a saranna fi alogo a xa fa falan ti n xa na kiini. <verse eid="NEH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13"/>A na liga nɛn alogo n xa gaxu a yɛɛ ra, n yi a maxadi xuiin suxu, n yi yulubin tongo. Nayi, e yi nɔɛ n xili kalɛ nɛn, n yi yagi.<verse eid="NEH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14"/>N ma Ala, Tobiya nun Sanbalata naxan ligama n na, na xa rabira i ma, e nun nabi ɲaxanla Nowadi nun nabiin bonna naxanye kata n magaxudeni.<verse eid="NEH 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15"/>Taan yinna yi raɲan Elulu kiken xi mɔxɔɲɛn nun suulunde lɔxɔni, xi tonge suulun e nun firinna bun. <verse eid="NEH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16"/>Nxu yaxune to a mɛ, e nun siyaan naxanye birin yi nxu rabilinxi, ne yi gaxu, e yi yagi e to a to a wanla bata yi raɲan alo nxɔ Ala sagoon kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NEH 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17"/>Na waxatine yi, Yuda muxu gbeene yi bataxine sɛbɛma Tobiya ma waxatin birin, Tobiya fan yi e yabima. <verse eid="NEH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18"/>Yuda kaan wuyaxi bata yi e kɔlɔ a xa, amasɔtɔ Sɛkani bitanna nan yi a ra, Araa dii xɛmɛna, e nun a dii xɛmɛn Yehoxanan bata yi Mesulan ma dii tɛmɛn tongo, Bereki a dii xɛmɛna. <verse eid="NEH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19"/>E yɛtɛɛn yi a xili faɲin fala n yɛɛ xɔri, e yi n ma falane rali a ma. Tobiya fan yi kɛdine rasigama alogo a xa n magaxu.<verse eid="NEH 6:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn makantan fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1"/>Taan yinna to yelin tiyɛ, n yi a dɛɛne ti a ma, kantan tiine nun bɛti baane nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yi ti e wanle ra. <verse eid="NEH 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2"/>N yi Yerusalɛn kuntigiyaan taxu ngaxakedenna Xanani ra e nun Xananiya, Yerusalɛn yire makantanxin kuntigina. Lannaya muxu gbeen nan yi Xananiya ra, e nun Ala yɛɛragaxu muxuna dangu bonne ra. <verse eid="NEH 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3"/>N yi a fala e xa, n naxa, “Yerusalɛn dɛɛne mi rabima fɔ sogen na te, a mɔn balanma nɛn wurene ra ɲinbanna ra benun kantan tiine xa siga. Yerusalɛn kaane yi ti kantan tideni, ndee yi siga taan kantan tidene yi, bonne yi lu e konne kantanɲɛ.”<verse eid="NEH 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4"/>Taan yi gbo, koni yamaan mi yi wuya, banxine fan munma yi ɲɔxɔ yiti singen. <verse eid="NEH 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5"/>N ma Ala yi a sa n bɔɲɛni a n xa fonne malan e nun kitisane nun yamaan birin alogo n xa muxune yatɛ. N yi bɔnsɔn kɛdina nde to, muxun naxanye singe xɛtɛ sa keli konyiyani, n yi ito to sɛbɛxi na ma:<verse eid="NEH 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EZR 2:1-70">Esirasi 2.1-70</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6"/>Babilɔn mangan Nebukadanesari siga muxun naxanye ra konyiyani, ne wuyaxi yi xɛtɛ Yerusalɛn nun Yuda yi, birin yi siga a taa yi. <verse eid="NEH 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7"/>E yi xɛtɛ e nun Sorobabeli nun Yosuwe nun Neyemi nun Asari nun Raamiya nun Naxamani nun Marodoke nun Bilisan nun Misipereti nun Bigiwayi nun Nexun e nun Banaha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Isirayila yamaan xɛmɛne yatɛn ni i ra:<verse eid="NEH 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8"/>Parosi xabilani, muxu wuli firin muxu kɛmɛ muxu tonge solofere e nun firin.<verse eid="NEH 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9"/>Sɛfati xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ saxan muxu tonge solofere muxu firin.<verse eid="NEH 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10"/>Ara xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ sennin muxu tonge suulun e nun firin.<verse eid="NEH 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11"/>Paxata-Moyaba xabilani, Yosuwe nun Yowaba yixɛtɛne yɛ, muxu wuli firin kɛmɛ solomasɛxɛ muxu fu nun solomasɛxɛ.<verse eid="NEH 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12"/>Elan xabilani, muxu wuli keden muxu kɛmɛ firin muxu tonge suulun e nun naanin.<verse eid="NEH 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13"/>Satu xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ solomasɛxɛ muxu tonge naanin e nun suulun.<verse eid="NEH 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14"/>Sakayi xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ solofere muxu tonge sennin.<verse eid="NEH 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15"/>Binuwi xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ sennin muxu tonge naanin e nun solomasɛxɛ.<verse eid="NEH 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16"/>Bebayi xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ sennin muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomasɛxɛ.<verse eid="NEH 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17"/>Asagada xabilani, muxu wuli firin muxu kɛmɛ saxan muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin.<verse eid="NEH 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18"/>Adonikami xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ sennin muxu tonge sennin e nun solofere.<verse eid="NEH 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19"/>Bigiwayi xabilani, muxu wuli firin muxu tonge sennin e nun solofere.<verse eid="NEH 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20"/>Adin xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ sennin muxu tonge suulun e nun suulun.<verse eid="NEH 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21"/>Ateri xabilani, Xesekiya yixɛtɛne yɛ, muxu tonge solomanaanin muxu solomasɛxɛ.<verse eid="NEH 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22"/>Xasun xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ saxan muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomasɛxɛ.<verse eid="NEH 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23"/>Besayi xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ saxan muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin.<verse eid="NEH 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24"/>Xarifi xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="NEH 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25"/>Gabayon kaane yɛ, muxu tonge solomanaanin muxu suulun.<verse eid="NEH 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26"/>Bɛtɛlɛmi kaane nun Netofa kaane yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ muxu tonge solomasɛxɛ muxu solomasɛxɛ.<verse eid="NEH 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27"/>Anatɔti kaane yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomasɛxɛ.<verse eid="NEH 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28"/>Beti-Asamawɛti kaane yɛ, muxu tonge naanin muxu firin.<verse eid="NEH 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29"/>Kiriyati-Yeyarin kaane nun Kefira kaane nun Beroti kaane yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ solofere muxu tonge naanin muxu saxan.<verse eid="NEH 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30"/>Rama kaane nun Geba kaane yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ sennin muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun keden.<verse eid="NEH 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31"/>Mikimasi kaane yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin.<verse eid="NEH 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32"/>Betɛli kaane nun Ayi kaane yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan.<verse eid="NEH 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33"/>Nebo bonna muxune yɛ, muxu tonge suulun muxu firin.<verse eid="NEH 7:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34"/>Elan bonne xabilan muxune yɛ, muxu wuli keden muxu kɛmɛ firin muxu tonge suulun e nun naanin.<verse eid="NEH 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35"/>Xarimi xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ saxan muxu mɔxɔɲɛ.<verse eid="NEH 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36"/>Yeriko kaane yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ saxan muxu tonge naanin e nun suulun.<verse eid="NEH 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37"/>Lodi kaane nun Xadidi kaane nun Ono kaane yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ solofere muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun keden.<verse eid="NEH 7:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38"/>Sena kaane yɛ, muxu wuli saxan muxu kɛmɛ solomanaanin muxu tonge saxan.<verse eid="NEH 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39"/>Saraxaraline yɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:39">Yɛdaya xabilani Yosuwe a denbayani, muxu kɛmɛ solomanaanin muxu tonge solofere muxu saxan.<verse eid="NEH 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40"/>Imeri xabilani, muxu wuli keden muxu tonge suulun muxu firin.<verse eid="NEH 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41"/>Pasaxuri xabilani, muxu wuli keden muxu kɛmɛ firin muxu tonge naanin e nun solofere.<verse eid="NEH 7:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42"/>Xarimi xabilani, muxu wuli keden muxu fu nun solofere.<verse eid="NEH 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:43">Yosuwe xabilani, Kadamile nun Hodawi yixɛtɛne yɛ, muxu tonge solofere e nun naanin.<verse eid="NEH 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44"/>Bɛti baane:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:44">Asafi xabilani, muxu kɛmɛ muxu tonge naanin e nun solomasɛxɛ.<verse eid="NEH 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45"/>Kantan muxune:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:45">Salun nun Ateri nun Talamɔn nun Akubu nun Xatita nun Sobayi yixɛtɛne yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ muxu tonge saxan e nun solomasɛxɛ.<verse eid="NEH 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46"/>Ala Batu Banxin walikɛne:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:46">E benbane nan itoe ra: Sixa nun Xasufa nun Tabayoti nun <verse eid="NEH 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47"/>Kerosi nun Siya nun Padon nun <verse eid="NEH 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48"/>Lebana nun Xagaba nun Salamayi nun <verse eid="NEH 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49"/>Xanan nun Gideli nun Gaxara nun <verse eid="NEH 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50"/>Reyaya nun Resin nun Nekoda nun <verse eid="NEH 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51"/>Gasami nun Yusa nun Paseya nun <verse eid="NEH 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52"/>Besayi nun Meyunin nun Nefusin nun <verse eid="NEH 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53"/>Bakabuku nun Xakufa nun Xaraxuru nun <verse eid="NEH 7:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54"/>Basaliti nun Mexida nun Xarasa nun <verse eid="NEH 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55"/>Barakosi nun Sisera nun Tama nun <verse eid="NEH 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56"/>Nesixa e nun Xatifa.<verse eid="NEH 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57"/>Sulemani a walikɛne yixɛtɛne yɛ: Sotayi nun Sofereti nun Perida nun <verse eid="NEH 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58"/>Yaala nun Darakon nun Gideli nun <verse eid="NEH 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59"/>Sɛfati nun Xatili nun Pokereti-Hasebayin nun Amɔn.<verse eid="NEH 7:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60"/>Ala Batu Banxin walikɛne birin malanxina e nun Sulemani a walikɛne: muxu kɛmɛ saxan muxu tonge solomanaanin muxu firin.<verse eid="NEH 7:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61"/>Muxuni itoe nan keli Tela-Mela nun Tela-Harasa nun Kerubu-Adan nun Imeri taane yi, koni ne mi e xabilane kolon naxan a yitɛ fa fala Isirayila kaan nan e ra:<verse eid="NEH 7:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62"/>Dɛlaya nun Tobiya nun Nekoda yixɛtɛne yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ sennin muxu tonge naanin e nun firin.<verse eid="NEH 7:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63"/>Saraxaralina ndee yi na: Xobaya nun Hakɔsi nun Barasilayi yixɛtɛne. Barasilayi bata Galadi kaan Barasilayi a dii tɛmɛn dɔxɔ, na nan xili te a xun ma.<verse eid="NEH 7:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64"/>E yi kata e xabilane fendeni bɔnsɔn kɛdine kui, koni e mi e to. E yi e ba saraxarali wanla ra.<verse eid="NEH 7:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65"/>Yamana kanna yi yamarin fi a muxu yo nama se sariɲanxine don e yɛ han saraxaralina nde yi sɔtɔ naxan masɛnsɛn ti seene rawalɛ, Yurima nun Tumin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.65</char> <char style="fk">Yurima nun Tumin</char> masɛnsɛn ti seene fe sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 28.30 kui. Saraxaraline yi masɛnsɛnna tima ne nan na alogo e xa Ala sagoon kolon.</note><verse eid="NEH 7:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66"/>Yamaan birin malanxina, muxu wuli tonge naanin muxu wuli firin muxu kɛmɛ saxan muxu tonge sennin.<verse eid="NEH 7:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67"/>E walikɛ xɛmɛne nun e walikɛ ɲaxanle mi yi ne yɛ, ne muxu wuli solofere muxu kɛmɛ saxan tonge saxan e nun solofere nan yi a ra. Bɛti ba xɛmɛn nun a ɲaxanle, muxu kɛmɛ firin tonge naanin e nun suulun yi e yɛ. <verse eid="NEH 7:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68"/>Ɲɔgɔmɛn kɛmɛ naanin tonge saxan e nun suulun, sofanla wuli sennin kɛmɛ solofere e nun mɔxɔɲɛ fan yi na.<verse eid="NEH 7:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69"/>Denbaya xun wuyaxi seene fi nɛn wanla fe yi. Yamana kanna yi xɛmaan kilo solomasɛxɛ e nun a tagi nun igelengen tonge suulun e nun saraxarali domaan kɛmɛ suulun tonge saxan fi wanla fe yi. <verse eid="NEH 7:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70"/>Denbaya xunne yi xɛmaan kilo kɛmɛ kilo tonge solofere nun gbeti fixɛn kilo wuli keden kilo kɛmɛ ba. <verse eid="NEH 7:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71"/>Isirayila yamaan muxu dɔnxɛne yi xɛmaan kilo kɛmɛ tonge solofere nun gbeti fixɛn kilo wuli keden ba e nun saraxarali domaan tonge sennin e nun solofere.<verse eid="NEH 7:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72"/>Saraxaraline nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune nun kantan tiine nun bɛti baane nun Ala Batu Banxin walikɛne nun Isirayila yamaan birin yi dɔxɔ e taane yi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="NEH 7:72">Esirasi yi sariyan xaran yamani</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:72">Ɲɛɛn kike soloferedena a liyɛ, Isirayila kaane birin bata yi dɔxɔ e taane yi.<verse eid="NEH 7:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1"/>Yamaan birin yi e malan yama malandeni Ige Dɛɛn na alo muxu kedenna. E yi a fala sɛbɛli tiina Esirasi xa a xa fa Musaa sariya kɛdin na, Alatala sariyan naxan yamari Isirayila kaane ma. <verse eid="NEH 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2"/>Saraxaralina Esirasi yi fa sariya kɛdin na yamaan birin yɛtagi, xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla, naxanye birin yi nɔɛ falan famunɲɛ e naxan mɛma. Kike solofereden xi singen nan yi a ra.<verse eid="NEH 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3"/>Keli xɔtɔnni han yanyi tagini, Esirasi na sariya kɛdin xaranma yamaan yɛtagi Ige Dɛɛn na, xɛmɛne nun ɲaxanle nun naxanye birin yi a famuma. Yamaan birin yi tuli matixi sariya kɛdin xaran xuiin na. <verse eid="NEH 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4"/>Sɛbɛli tiina Esirasi yi tixi wudi gbingbinna nan fari, naxan yi rafalaxi na feen ma. Matitiya nun Sema nun Anaya nun Yuriya nun Xiliki nun Maaseya yi tixi a fɛma a yiifanna ma. Pɛdaya nun Mikayeli nun Malakiya nun Xasun nun Xasabadana nun Sakari nun Mesulan tixi a kɔmɛnna ma. <verse eid="NEH 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5"/>Esirasi yi kɛdin nabi yamaan birin yɛtagi, a tixi e birin xun ma, a to kɛdin nabi, yamaan birin yi keli. <verse eid="NEH 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6"/>Esirasi yi Alatala tantun, Ala naxan gbo, yamaan yi lu e yiine yitɛ kore, e yi a yabi, e naxa, “Amina! Amina!” Nayi, e birin yi e xinbi sin, e yɛtagine yi lan bɔxɔn ma, e yi Alatala batu. <verse eid="NEH 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune, Yosuwe nun Bani nun Serebi nun Yamin nun Akubu nun Sabetayi nun Hodiya nun Maaseya nun Kelita nun Asari nun Yosabadi nun Xanan nun Pɛlaya, ne yi lu yamaan tixin xaranɲɛ sariyan ma. <verse eid="NEH 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8"/>Ne yi lu Alaa sariya kɛdin xaranɲɛ yamaan xa, e lu a yɛbɛ e xa alogo e birin xa nɔ a famunɲɛ.<verse eid="NEH 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9"/>Nayi, yamana kanna Neyemi nun Esirasi naxan yi saraxaraliyaan nun sɛbɛli tiini, e nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxun naxanye yi yamaan xaranma, ne yi a fala yamaan xa, e naxa, “Lɔxɔni ito bata rasariɲan Alatala xa, ɛ Ala. Ɛ nama lu sunuxi, ɛ lu wugɛ.” Bayo yamaan birin yi wugama nɛn, e nɛma yi sariya kɛdin xaran xuiin namɛma. <verse eid="NEH 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10"/>Neyemi yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ sa donse faɲin don, ɛ yi minse faɲin min, ɛ siga ndee ra muxune xa se mi naxanye yii, amasɔtɔ to lɔxɔn bata findi lɔxɔ sariɲanxin na en Marigin xa. Ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ rasunu, bayo Alatalaa sɛwan nan findixi ɛ sɛnbɛn na.” <verse eid="NEH 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yi yamaan birin masabari, e naxa, “Ɛ sabari, amasɔtɔ to lɔxɔn sariɲan, ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ rasunu!”<verse eid="NEH 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12"/>Yamaan birin yi siga e dɛgeden nun e mindeni. Se mi yi naxanye yii, e yi ndee so ne yii. E lu sɛwa gbeeni, bayo e bata yi falane famu naxanye yɛba e xa.<verse eid="NEH 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bubu Kui Sanla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13"/>Na xɔtɔn bode, Isirayila denbaya xunne nun saraxaraline nun Lewine birin yi e malan sɛbɛli tiina Esirasi fɛma alogo e xa sariya falane ramɛ. <verse eid="NEH 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14"/>Alatala sariya kɛdin naxan so Musa yii, a yi sɛbɛxi na kui fa fala, Isirayila kaane yi lanma e lu bubune kui Bubu Kui Sanla waxatini ɲɛɛn kike solofereden na. <verse eid="NEH 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15"/>E lan e yi na rali birin ma e taane yi e nun Yerusalɛn yi, e naxa, “Ɛ mini geya yireni, ɛ fa Oliwi bili yii taa kui xiine nun burunna xiine nun miriti bili yiine nun tugu yiine nun wudi yii ɲingixine ra alogo ɛ xa fa Bubu Kui Sanla raba alo a sɛbɛxi kii naxan yi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.15</char> <char style="fk">Bubu Kui Sanla</char> fe sɛbɛxi Saraxaraline 23.33-38 kui.</note> <verse eid="NEH 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16"/>Nayi, Isirayila yamaan yi mini, e siga ɲɔxɔnde fendeni, alogo e xa fa Bubu Kui Sanla raba e banxine dɛ ra hanma e sansanne kui, hanma Ala Batu Banxin sansanne kui, e nun yama malandene yi Ige Dɛɛn nun Efirami Dɛɛn na. <verse eid="NEH 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17"/>Muxun naxanye birin yi malanxi na, naxanye yi faxi sa keli konyiyani, ne birin yi bubune ti, e dɔxɔ e bubune yi. Keli Nunu a dii xɛmɛn Yosuwe a waxatin ma han na waxatini, Isirayila kaane munma yi na fe sifan liga singen, sɛwa gbeen yi lu e tagi.<verse eid="NEH 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18"/>E lu Alaa sariya kɛdin xaranɲɛ lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ keli xi singen ma han lɔxɔ dɔnxɛna. E yi sanla raba xi solofere, yamaan yi e malan xi solomasɛxɛdeni, alo sariyana a falaxi kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NEH 8:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9"/>
  <para style="s">E yi e ti e yulubin na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1"/>Kiken xi mɔxɔɲɛde lɔxɔni, Isirayila kaane yi e malan, e sun, e kasa bɛnbɛli dugine ragodo e ma, e burunburunna sa e xunne yi sunu taxamasenne ra. <verse eid="NEH 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2"/>Naxanye yi findixi Isirayila kaane ra, ne yi e masiga xɔɲɛne ra, e yi e ti e yulubine ra e nun e benbane gbeene. <verse eid="NEH 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3"/>E to keli, e ti, e yi Alatala, e Alaa sariya kɛdin xaran waxati xunkuye. Yanyin na, e yi e xinbi sin Alatala yɛtagi, e Ala, e mɔn yi e ti e yulubine ra han waxati xunkuye. <verse eid="NEH 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxuna ndee yi keli, e te gbingbinna fari, Yosuwe nun Bani nun Kadamile nun Sɛbaniha nun Bunni nun Serebi nun Bani nun Kenani. Ne yi e xuini te Alatala ma, e Ala. <verse eid="NEH 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune, Yosuwe nun Kadamile nun Bani nun Xasabaneya nun Serebi nun Hodiya nun Sɛbaniha nun Petaxi yi a fala, e naxa, “Ɛ keli, en Alatala, en ma Ala tantun habadan han habadan!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 9:5">E yi Ala maxandi, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">“Nxu i xili binyen tantunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">tantunna naxan dangu binyen nun tantunna birin na!<verse eid="NEH 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6"/>I tan nan keden pe Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">i tan naxan ariyanna nun kore xɔnna nun sarene birin daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">i bɔxɔ xɔnna nun a yi seene birin da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">e nun baane nun e yi seene birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">I yi niin bira niimaseene birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">malekane birin e xinbi sinma i tan nan bun.<verse eid="NEH 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7"/>I tan Marigina Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">i tan nan Iburama sugandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">i yi a ramini Yuru taani Babilɔn yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">i yi a xili sa, Iburahima.<verse eid="NEH 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8"/>I yi a to a dɛnkɛlɛyaxi i ma a bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">i yi layirin xidi ɛ tagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">a i xa Kanan kaane nun Xitine nun Amorine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">nun Perisine nun Yebusune</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">nun Girigasane yamanan so a bɔnsɔnna yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">I dɛ xuiin nakamali nɛn bayo i tinxin.”<verse eid="NEH 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9"/>“I nxu benbane ɲaxankatan to nɛn Misiran yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:9">i yi e gbelegbele xuiin mɛ Gbala Baan dɛ.<verse eid="NEH 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10"/>I yi taxamasenne nun kabanako feene yita Firawona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">nun a walikɛne nun a yamanan muxune birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">Amasɔtɔ i a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">e nxu benbane suxu kii naxan yi wasoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">I yi xinla sɔtɔ naxan gbo han to.<verse eid="NEH 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11"/>I yi baa igeni taxun e yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">e yi baani gidi a yixaren na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">koni i tilin igen nadin nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">e sagatan muxune xun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">alo gɛmɛna igen xɔnna ma.<verse eid="NEH 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12"/>I yi kundaan ti e yɛɛ ra yanyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:12">i yi tɛ dɛgɛn ti e yɛɛ ra kɔɛɛn na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:12">naxan yi kirani yalanma e yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="NEH 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13"/>I godo nɛn keli kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">i falan ti e xa Sinayi geyaan fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">I yi i gelene fala e xa naxanye tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">e nun ɲɔndin sariyan nun tɔnne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">nun yamarin naxanye fan.<verse eid="NEH 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14"/>Fata i ya walikɛɛn Musa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:14">i yi i ya Matabu Lɔxɔ sariɲanxin nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:14">i ya yamarine nun sariyane nun tɔnne yita e ra.<verse eid="NEH 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15"/>Kamɛn to e suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">i yi donseen nagodo e ma keli kore.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">Min xɔnla to e suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">i yi igen namini fanyeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">i yi a fala e xa a e xa so yamanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">i kɔlɔ naxan so fe ra e benbane yii.<verse eid="NEH 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16"/>Koni nxu benbane murutɛ nɛn wasoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:16">e mi i ya yamarine suxu.<verse eid="NEH 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17"/>E mi tin e suxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">e ɲinan i ya kabanako feene xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">i naxanye liga e xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">e yi e bɔɲɛni xɔdɔxɔ e murutɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">e yi a nata</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">a e xa yɛɛrati gbɛtɛ sugandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">e xɛtɛ e konyiyani Misiran yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.17</char> Yatɛne 14.4</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Koni i tan mi i mɛ e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Ala nan i tan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">naxan muxune mafeluma e yulubine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">I diɲa, i kininkinin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">i mi xɔlɔn xulɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">i ya hinanna gbo.<verse eid="NEH 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18"/>E yi ɲinge di sawura wure daxin nafala e yɛtɛ xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:18">e naxa, ‘En ma Ala nan ito ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:18">naxan en naminixi Misiran yi.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:18">E yi fala ɲaxine ti i ma.<verse eid="NEH 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19"/>Koni i ya kininkinin gbeeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">i mi e rabeɲin tonbonni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">Kundaan lu nɛn e yɛɛ ra kiraan xɔn yanyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">tɛ dɛgɛn yi lu e yɛɛ ra kɔɛɛn na.<verse eid="NEH 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20"/>I yi i ya Nii faɲin naso e yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:20">alogo a xa e xaran,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:20">i yi i ya Manna donseen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.20</char> <char style="fk">Manna donsena</char> a fe mato Xɔrɔyaan 16.13-15 nun 16.31 kui.</note> so e yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:20">e nun igena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:20">min xɔnla to e suxu.<verse eid="NEH 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21"/>I yi i yengi dɔxɔ e xɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">tonbonni ɲɛɛ tonge naanin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">sese mi dasa e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">e dugine mi kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">e sanne mi kusin.<verse eid="NEH 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22"/>I yamanane nun siyane so nɛn e yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">i yi e rabilinna yamanane birin sa e sagoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">E yi Xɛsibɔn mangan Sixɔn ma yamanan tongo e gbeen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">e nun Ogo a yamanana, Basan mangana.<verse eid="NEH 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23"/>I yi e diine rawuya ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:23">alo sarene kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:23">i yi e raso yamanani, i kɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:23">e benbane xa dɛnaxan ma fe yi.<verse eid="NEH 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24"/>E yixɛtɛne yi so mɛnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">e dɔxɔ na yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">i yi na yamanan muxune rayagi e yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">Kanan kaane, i yi e sa e sagoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">e mangane nun e yamanane muxune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">alogo e xa e raba e waxɔnna ra.<verse eid="NEH 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25"/>E yi taa makantanxine tongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">e nun bɔxɔ faɲina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">e yi banxine tongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">naxanye yi rafexi se faɲin sifan birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">e nun xɔɲinne nun manpa binle</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">nun oliwi binle nun wudi bogila wuyaxine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">e yi e don, e yi lugo, e yi gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">e yi lu hɛri gbeeni.”<verse eid="NEH 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26"/>“Koni, e keli nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">e yi murutɛ i xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">E yi e xun xanbi so i ya sariyane yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">e yi nabine faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">naxanye yi e mabandunma i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">e yi Ala rayelefu gbeene ti.<verse eid="NEH 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27"/>Nayi, i yi e sa e yaxune sagoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">ne yi e tɔrɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">Koni e ɲaxankatan waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">e xui ramini nɛn i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">i yi e xuiin namɛ kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">i yi e yabi i ya kininkinin gbeeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">i yi e xunba muxune fi e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">naxanye e ba e yaxune yii.<verse eid="NEH 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28"/>Koni, e xɔrɔyaan sɔtɔ nɛn tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">e mɔn yi fe ɲaxine liga fɔlɔ i yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">Nayi, i yi e rabeɲin e yaxune yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">e yi e nɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">Koni, e mɔn yi e xui ramini i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">i yi e xuiin namɛ kore xɔnna ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">i ya kininkinin gbeeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">i mɔn yi e rakisi sanɲa ma wuyaxi.<verse eid="NEH 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29"/>I yi e mabandun i ya sariyan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">koni e yi findi wasodene ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">e mi e tuli mati i ya yamarine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">E yi yulubin liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">e i ya kiti saxine kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">anu naxan na e suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">na kanna nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn e xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">E yi murutɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">e tondi e tuli matiyɛ i tan na.<verse eid="NEH 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30"/>I ti nɛn e bun ma ɲɛɛ wuyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">i yi e rakolon i ya Nii Sariɲanxin na nabine xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">koni e mi e tuli mati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">Nayi, i yi e sa e yamana gbɛtɛye sagoni.<verse eid="NEH 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31"/>I ya kininkinin gbeeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:31">i mi e raxɔri, i mi e rabeɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:31">bayo Ala diɲaxi kininkininxin nan i tan na.”<verse eid="NEH 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32"/>“Iki, nxɔ Ala, Ala gbeena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">sɛnbɛmana, i tan naxan magaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">i tan naxan i ya layirin nakamalima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">i ya hinanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">fe xɔlɛn naxanye nxu sɔtɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">e nun nxɔ mangane nun nxɔ nabine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">nun nxɔ saraxaraline nun nxu benbane nun yamaan birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">i nama ne yatɛ fe fuune ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">sa fɔlɔ Asiriya mangane waxatin ma han to.<verse eid="NEH 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33"/>Feen naxanye birin nxu sɔtɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:33">i tan tinxin ne birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:33">bayo i ya lannayaan yita nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:33">koni nxu tan fe ɲaxin nan liga.<verse eid="NEH 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34"/>Nxɔ mangane nun nxɔ kuntigine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">nun nxɔ saraxaraline</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">nun nxu benbane mi i ya sariyane suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">e mi i ya yamarine suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">e nun i ya maxadi xuine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">i yi naxanye falama e xa.<verse eid="NEH 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35"/>E yi e yamanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">waxatin naxan yi hɛri gbeeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">i naxan so e yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">yamana sabatixi gbeeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">i naxan sa e sagoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">e mi i batu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">e mi xɛtɛ e kɛwali ɲaxine fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="NEH 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36"/>To, nxu bata findi konyine ra yamanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:36">i naxan so nxu benbane yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:36">alogo e xa balo na bogiseene nun a se faɲine ra.<verse eid="NEH 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37"/>A seene bata findi mangane gbeene ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">i nxu saxi naxanye sagoni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">masɔtɔ nxu yulubine xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">Nxu nun nxɔ xuruseene bata lu e sagoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">nxu lu ɲaxankata gbeeni.”<verse eid="NEH 9:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10"/>
  <para style="s">Sariyan suxu fena yamaan xɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1"/>“Amasɔtɔ na feene birin xɔn, nxu tan Isirayila kaane bata lan feni ito ma, nxu yi a sɛbɛ, nxɔ kuntigine nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxun naxanye nxu yɛ, e nun nxɔ saraxaraline yi e yii fɔxɔn sa a ma.”<verse eid="NEH 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2"/>Muxun naxanye e yii fɔxɔn sa a ma, ne xinle ni itoe ra: Yamana kanna Neyemi, Xakaliyaa diina e nun Sedeki nun <verse eid="NEH 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3"/>Seraya nun Asari nun Yeremi nun <verse eid="NEH 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4"/>Pasaxuri nun Amari nun Malakiya nun <verse eid="NEH 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5"/>Xatusi nun Sɛbaniha nun Maluku nun <verse eid="NEH 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6"/>Xarimi nun Meremoti nun Abadi nun <verse eid="NEH 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7"/>Daniyɛli nun Gineton nun Baruku nun <verse eid="NEH 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8"/>Mesulan nun Abiya nun Miyamin nun <verse eid="NEH 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9"/>Maasiya nun Biligayi nun Semaya. Saraxaraline nan yi ne ra.<verse eid="NEH 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10"/>Lewine yɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:10">Asani a dii xɛmɛn Yosuwe nun Xenadadaa diine Binuwi nun Kadamile <verse eid="NEH 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11"/>e nun e ngaxakedenne: Sɛbaniha nun Hodiya nun Kelita nun Pɛlaya nun Xanan <verse eid="NEH 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12"/>nun Mika nun Rexobo nun Hasabi <verse eid="NEH 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13"/>nun Sakuru nun Serebi nun Sɛbaniha <verse eid="NEH 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14"/>nun Hodiya nun Bani nun Beninu.<verse eid="NEH 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15"/>Yamaan kuntigine yɛ: Parosi nun Paxata-Moyaba nun Elan nun Satu nun Bani nun <verse eid="NEH 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16"/>Bunni nun Asagada nun Bebayi nun <verse eid="NEH 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17"/>Adoniya nun Bigiwayi nun Adin nun <verse eid="NEH 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18"/>Ateri nun Xesekiya nun Asuru nun <verse eid="NEH 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19"/>Hodiya nun Xasun nun Besayi nun <verse eid="NEH 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20"/>Xarifi nun Anatɔti nun Nebayi nun <verse eid="NEH 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21"/>Magapiyasi nun Mesulan nun Xesiri nun <verse eid="NEH 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22"/>Mesesabele nun Sadɔki nun Yaduwa nun <verse eid="NEH 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23"/>Pɛlati nun Xanan nun Anaya nun <verse eid="NEH 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24"/>Hoseya nun Xananiya nun Xasubu nun <verse eid="NEH 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25"/>Haloxesi nun Pilixa nun Sobeki nun <verse eid="NEH 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26"/>Rexun nun Xasabana nun Maaseya nun <verse eid="NEH 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27"/>Axiya nun Xanan nun Anan nun <verse eid="NEH 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28"/>Maluku nun Xarimi nun Banaha.<verse eid="NEH 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29"/>Yamaan dɔnxɛn birin yi sa e fari, saraxaraline nun Lewine nun taan dɛ kantanne nun bɛti baane nun Ala Batu Banxin walikɛne nun muxun naxanye birin xɛtɛ nxu rabilinna siyane fɔxɔ ra, e bira Alaa sariyan fɔxɔ ra, e yi e mali, e ɲaxanle nun e dii xɛmɛne nun e dii tɛmɛn naxanye birin yi nɔɛ feen famunɲɛ. <verse eid="NEH 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30"/>E birin yi sa e ngaxakedenne fari, e kuntigine. E yi e kɔlɔ a e xa Alaa sariyan suxu, a walikɛɛn Musa naxan nalixi nxu ma, nxu yi nxu Marigina Alatalaa sariyane nun yamarine birin suxu. <verse eid="NEH 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31"/>Nxu bata yi dɛ xuiin tongo a nxu nama nxɔ dii tɛmɛne fi siya gbɛtɛne ma naxanye dɔxi nxɔ yamanani, nxu mɔn mi e dii tɛmɛne tongoma ɲaxanle ra nxɔ dii xɛmɛne xa. <verse eid="NEH 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32"/>Na muxune yulane na fa Matabu Lɔxɔni hanma lɔxɔ sariɲanxine yi, nxu nama yulaya se yo sara ne ma hanma donseene. Nxu yi bɔxɔn fan lu a yi a matabu ɲɛɛ soloferedeni, nxu mi xɛɛn bima na ɲɛɛn na, nxu donle fan nakala ayi.<verse eid="NEH 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33"/>Nxu bata sariyan sa fa fala nxu xa gbeti fixɛn garamu naanin fi ɲɛɛ yo ɲɛɛ, a findi nxɔ Ala Batu Banxin nawali seen na. <verse eid="NEH 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34"/>A xa findi buru rasariɲanxin saren na, e nun bogise saraxane nun saraxa gan daxine nun saraxan naxanye bama Matabu Lɔxɔne ma e nun kike nɛnɛn sanle hanma sali lɔxɔ gbɛtɛye ma. A tan nan mɔn findima saraxa gbɛtɛye saren na saraxa sariɲanxine nun yulubi xafari saraxane ra Isirayila xa, e nun wanle birin en ma Ala Batu Banxini.<verse eid="NEH 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35"/>Nxu tan saraxaraline nun Lewine nun yamaan bata masɛnsɛnna ti alogo a xa kolon muxune lanma e xa fa yegen na waxatin naxan yi Ala Batu Banxini denbaya yɛɛn ma ɲɛɛ yo ɲɛɛ alogo a xa gan Alatalaa saraxa gandeni, en ma Ala, alo a sɛbɛxi kii naxan yi sariyani. <verse eid="NEH 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36"/>Nxu bata dɛ xuiin tongo a nxu xa fa nxɔ bɔxɔn bogise singene nun wudi bogi singene ra Alatala Batu Banxini, <verse eid="NEH 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37"/>nxu yi fa nxɔ dii singene nun nxɔ xuruseene dii singene ra Ala yɛtagi, alo sariyana a falaxi kii naxan yi. Nxu fa nxɔ ɲingene dii singene nun yɛxɛne nun siine dii singene ra Ala Batu Banxini. Nxu yi e so saraxaraline yii naxanye walima Ala Batu Banxini. <verse eid="NEH 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38"/>Nxu mɔn yi siga nxɔ sansi singene ra saraxaraline xɔn Ala Batu Banxin se ramaradeni, e nun bogise saraxane nun wudi bogine nun manpa nɛnɛn nun turena. Bɔxɔn bogiseene yaganna yi findi Lewine gbeen na. E tan nan yati e rasuxuma taane birin yi nxu dɛnaxanye bima. <verse eid="NEH 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39"/>Harunaa yixɛtɛna nde luma nɛn Lewine fɔxɔ ra e nɛma sigɛ yaganne tongodeni waxatin naxan yi. Lewine yi na yaganna dɔxɔde fuden xali Ala Batu Banxin gbeti ramaradeni. <verse eid="NEH 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 10:40"/>Isirayila kaane nun Lewine sigama nɛn e murutune nun manpa nɛnɛne nun turen yaganne ra Ala Batu Banxin se ramaradeni, yire sariɲanxin goronne dɛnaxan yi, Ala Batu Banxin saraxaraline nun dɛ kantanne nun bɛti baane fan luma mɛnna nin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:40">Na kiini, en mi en ma Ala Batu Banxin nabeɲinma.<verse eid="NEH 10:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yuda kaan naxanye fa dɔxɔ Yerusalɛn yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1"/>Yamana kanne yi fa dɔxɔ Yerusalɛn yi. Yamaan dɔnxɛn yi masɛnsɛnna ti alogo muxu fu yɛ, muxu keden xa fa dɔxɔ Yerusalɛn yi, taa rasariɲanxina. Muxu fu yɛ, muxu solomanaanin nɔɛ luyɛ nɛn e kon taane yi. <verse eid="NEH 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2"/>Yamaan yi barika bira na muxune xa naxanye birin tin e xa fa dɔxɔ Yerusalɛn yi.<verse eid="NEH 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3"/>Yamana kanni itoe nan fa dɔxɔ Yerusalɛn yi, koni Isirayila kaana ndee nun saraxaraline nun Lewine nun Ala Batu Banxin walikɛne nun Sulemani a banxin walikɛne denbayane, ne yi lu e taani Yuda yi, birin yi lu a kon yi.<verse eid="NEH 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Singen 9.3-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4"/>Yuda kaana ndee nun Bunyamin kaana ndee fa dɔxɔ nɛn Yerusalɛn yi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:4">Yuda bɔnsɔnna muxune yɛ: Ataya. Yusiya nan Ataya sɔtɔ. Sakari nan Yusiya sɔtɔ. Amari nan Sakari sɔtɔ. Sɛfati nan Amari sɔtɔ. Mahalaleli nan Sɛfati sɔtɔ Peresi xabilani. <verse eid="NEH 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5"/>Maaseya fan fata Yuda bɔnsɔnna nan na. Baruku nan Maaseya sɔtɔ. Kola-Xose nan Baruku sɔtɔ. Xasaya nan Kola-Xose sɔtɔ. Adaya nan Xasaya sɔtɔ. Yoyaribi nan Adaya sɔtɔ. Sakari nan Yoyaribi sɔtɔ Silo xabilani. <verse eid="NEH 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6"/>Peresi yixɛtɛn naxanye yi dɔxi Yerusalɛn yi, sofa kɛndɛne: muxu kɛmɛ naanin muxu tonge sennin e nun solomasɛxɛ.<verse eid="NEH 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7"/>Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna muxune yɛ: Salu. Mesulan nan Salu sɔtɔ. Yowedi nan Mesulan sɔtɔ. Pɛdaya nan Yowedi sɔtɔ. Kolaya nan Pɛdaya sɔtɔ. Maaseya nan Kolaya sɔtɔ. Itiyeli nan Maaseya sɔtɔ. Yɛsaya nan Itiyeli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NEH 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8"/>Salu nun a fɔxɔrabirane nan yi a ra, Gabayi nun Salayi. Xɛmɛne gbansanna, muxu kɛmɛ solomanaanin muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomasɛxɛ nan yi Yerusalɛn yi Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna muxune ra. <verse eid="NEH 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9"/>Sikiri a diin Yowɛli nan yi e sofa kuntigin na, Hasɛnuwaa dii xɛmɛn Yuda nan yi taan kuntigi firinden na.<verse eid="NEH 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10"/>Saraxaraline yɛ: Yoyaribi a dii xɛmɛn Yɛdaya nun Yakin nun <verse eid="NEH 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11"/>Xiliki a diin Seraya. Mesulan nan Xiliki sɔtɔ. Sadɔki nan Mesulan sɔtɔ. Merayoti nan Sadɔki sɔtɔ. Axituba nan Merayoti sɔtɔ. Axituba yi findixi Ala Batu Banxin kuntigin nan na. <verse eid="NEH 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12"/>Ne nun e walikɛne yi muxu kɛmɛ solomasɛxɛ muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin nan xun na naxanye yi walima Ala Batu Banxini. Yeroxamaa diina Adaya yi findixi denbaya xunna nan na. Pelaliya nan Yeroxama sɔtɔ. Amasi nan Pelaliya sɔtɔ. Sakari nan Amasi sɔtɔ. Pasaxuri nan Sakari sɔtɔ. Malakiya nan Pasaxuri sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NEH 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13"/>Adaya nun a ngaxakedenne, muxu kɛmɛ firin muxu tonge naanin e nun firinna findi denbaya xunne nan na. Asarɛli a diina Amasasayi fan findi kuntigin nan na. Axasayi nan Asarɛli sɔtɔ. Mɛsilimɔti nan Axasayi sɔtɔ. Imeri nan Mesilemoti sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NEH 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14"/>Sofa kɛndɛn muxu kɛmɛ muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomasɛxɛ nan yi Amasasayi nun a ngaxakedenne yɛ. Hagedolimi a diin Sabadiyɛli nan yi e yamaan xunna ra.<verse eid="NEH 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yɛ: Xasubu a diin Semaya. Asirikami nan Xasubu sɔtɔ. Hasabi nan Asirikami sɔtɔ. Bunni nan Hasabi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NEH 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16"/>Sabetayi nun Yosabadi Lewi kuntigine yɛ, ne nan yi wanle kɛma naxanye yi Ala Batu Banxin fari ma. <verse eid="NEH 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17"/>Mikaa diin Matani fan yi na. Sabidi nan Mika sɔtɔ. Asafi nan Sabidi sɔtɔ. Asafi nan yi barika bira bɛtin bama sali waxatini. Bakabukiya fan yi na naxan yi findixi kuntigi firinden na a ngaxakedenne yɛ, e nun Samuwaa diina Abada, Galali mamandenna, Yedutun tolobitana. <verse eid="NEH 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18"/>E birin malanxina, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune, muxu kɛmɛ firin muxu tonge solomasɛxɛ e nun naanin nan yi taa sariɲanxini.<verse eid="NEH 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19"/>Dɛ kantanne yɛ: Akubu nun Talamɔn nun e ngaxakedenna naxanye yi dɛɛne kantanma, muxu kɛmɛ muxu tonge solofere e nun firin.<verse eid="NEH 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20"/>Isirayila kaa dɔnxɛne, saraxaraline nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune, ne yi dɔxi Yuda taane nin e benbane bɔxɔne yi. <verse eid="NEH 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21"/>Ala Batu Banxin walikɛne yi dɔxi Ofɛli geyaan nan fari. Sixa nun Gisipa nan yi e kuntigine ra.<verse eid="NEH 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22"/>Bani a diin Yusi nan yi Lewine xun na Yerusalɛn yi. Hasabi nan Bani sɔtɔ. Matani nan Hasabi sɔtɔ. Mika nan Matani sɔtɔ Asafi bɔnsɔnni. Asafi yixɛtɛne yi findixi Ala Batu Banxin bɛti baane nan na. <verse eid="NEH 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23"/>Bɛti baane yi mangana yamarin nan bun e nun sariyana lan lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ bɛtin ma. <verse eid="NEH 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24"/>Mesesabele a diin Petaxi, Yudaa diin Sera yixɛtɛne yɛ, na nan yi Isirayila yamaan xunna ra Perise mangan dɛxɔn.<verse eid="NEH 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudiyane Yerusalɛn fari ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25"/>Yuda bɔnsɔnna muxuna ndee yi sa dɔxɔ banxidɛne nun taadine yi: Kiriyati-Aruba nun Dibon nun Yekabaseli nun e rabilinne taane yi, <verse eid="NEH 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26"/>e nun Yosuwe nun Molada nun Beti-Pɛlɛti taane nun <verse eid="NEH 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27"/>Xasari-Suwali nun Bɛriseba nun e rabilinne taane, <verse eid="NEH 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28"/>e nun Sikilaga nun Mekona nun a rabilinna taane yi, <verse eid="NEH 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29"/>e nun En-Rimɔn nun Sora nun Yaramuti taane nun <verse eid="NEH 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30"/>Sanowa nun Adulan nun e rabilinne taane nun Lakisi nun a xɛɛne nun Aseka taan nun a banxidɛne. Nanara, e yi dɔxi Bɛriseba yi siga han Hinɔn lanbanna.<verse eid="NEH 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31"/>Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna muxun naxanye sa keli Geba yi, ne yi dɔxi Mikimasi nun Aya nun Betɛli taane nun e rabilinne nun <verse eid="NEH 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32"/>Anatɔti nun Nobi nun Ananiya nun <verse eid="NEH 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33"/>Xasori nun Rama nun Gitayin nun <verse eid="NEH 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34"/>Xadidi nun Seboyin nun Nebalati nun <verse eid="NEH 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35"/>Lodi nun Ono taane nun Yiirawanle Lanbanna nin.<verse eid="NEH 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36"/>Yuda yamanan Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxuna ndee yi dɔxi Bunyamin yamanan nin.<verse eid="NEH 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12"/>
  <para style="s">Saraxaraline nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1"/>Saraxaralini itoe nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxuni itoe nun Selatili a diin Sorobabeli nun Yosuwe nan xɛtɛ sa keli konyiyani yamana gbɛtɛ yi: Seraya nun Yeremi nun Esirasi nun <verse eid="NEH 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2"/>Amari nun Maluku nun Xatusi <verse eid="NEH 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3"/>nun Sɛkani nun Rexun nun Meremoti <verse eid="NEH 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4"/>nun Yido nun Gineton nun Abiya <verse eid="NEH 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5"/>nun Miyamin nun Maadiya nun Biliga <verse eid="NEH 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6"/>nun Semaya nun Yoyaribi nun Yɛdaya <verse eid="NEH 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7"/>nun Salu nun Amoki nun Xiliki nun Yɛdaya. Xɛmɛni itoe nun e ngaxakedenne nan findi saraxarali kuntigine ra Yosuwe waxatini.<verse eid="NEH 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune nan yi itoe ra: Yosuwe nun Binuwi nun Kadamile nun Serebi nun Yuda nun Matani. Matani nun a muxune nan yi barika bira bɛtine bama. <verse eid="NEH 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9"/>E ngaxakedenne Bakabukiya nun Yunni yi tixi e yɛtagi Ala batu waxatini.<verse eid="NEH 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saraxarali kuntigine yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10"/>Yosuwe yi Yoyakin sɔtɔ, Yoyakin yi Eliyasibi sɔtɔ, Eliyasibi yi Yoyada sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NEH 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11"/>Yoyada yi Yonatan sɔtɔ, Yonatan yi Yaduwa sɔtɔ.<verse eid="NEH 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12"/>Yoyakin yi saraxarali kuntigiyani waxatin naxan yi, muxuni itoe nan yi saraxaraline denbayane xunne ra:</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 12:12">Meraya, Serayaa denbaya xunna</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 12:12">e nun Xananiya, Yeremi a denbaya xunna<verse eid="NEH 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13"/>Esirasi, Mesulan ma denbaya xunna</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 12:13">e nun Yehoxanan, Amari a denbaya xunna<verse eid="NEH 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14"/>e nun Yonatan, Maluku a denbaya xunna</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 12:14">e nun Yusufu, Sɛbanihaa denbaya xunna<verse eid="NEH 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15"/>e nun Xarimi, Adanaa denbaya xunna</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 12:15">e nun Xelekayi, Merayoti a denbaya xunna<verse eid="NEH 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16"/>e nun Sakari, Yido a denbaya xunna</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 12:16">e nun Mesulan, Gineton ma denbaya xunna<verse eid="NEH 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17"/>e nun Sikiri, Abiyaa denbaya xunna</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 12:17">e nun Mowadi, Miniyamin ma denbaya xunna<verse eid="NEH 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18"/>e nun Samuwa, Biligaa denbaya xunna</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 12:18">e nun Yɛhonatan, Semayaa denbaya xunna<verse eid="NEH 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19"/>e nun Matenayi, Yoyaribi a denbaya xunna</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 12:19">e nun Yusi, Yɛdayaa denbaya xunna<verse eid="NEH 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20"/>e nun Kalayi, Salayi a denbaya xunna</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 12:20">e nun Eberi, Amoki a denbaya xunna<verse eid="NEH 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21"/>e nun Hasabi, Xiliki a denbaya xunna</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 12:21">e nun Natanɛli, Yɛdayaa denbaya xunna.<verse eid="NEH 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22"/>Eliyasibi nun Yoyada nun Yoxanan nun Yaduwa waxatini, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune denbaya xunne nun saraxaraline xinle sɛbɛ nɛn Perise kaan Dariyusi a mangayaan waxatini.<verse eid="NEH 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune denbaya xunne fan xinle sɛbɛ nɛn taruxu kɛdine kui han Eliyasibi a diin Yoxanan waxatina. <verse eid="NEH 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24"/>Hasabi nun Serebi nun Kadamile a diin Yosuwe nan yi Lewi bɔnsɔn xunne ra. Ala batu waxatini, e yi tima nɛn e ngaxakedenne yɛtagi, e Ala tantunma, e barikan bira Ala xa e ti yɛɛn ma alo Dawuda, Alaa muxuna a yamarixi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="NEH 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25"/>Matani nun Bakabukiya nun Abadi nun Mesulan nun Talamɔn nun Akubu nan yi Ala Batu Banxin se ramaraden dɛ kantanne ra. <verse eid="NEH 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26"/>E yi walima Yosuwe a dii xɛmɛn Yoyakin waxatin nin, Yosadaki mamandenna, e nun yamana kanna Neyemi waxatin nun saraxaraliin nun sɛbɛli tiina Esirasi waxatini.<verse eid="NEH 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛwana Yerusalɛn yinna fe yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27"/>Yerusalɛn yinna to yelin nafalɛ, e yi sa Lewine tongo alogo e mɔn xa fa dɔxɔ Yerusalɛn yi e lan ɲaxaɲaxani bayo Yerusalɛn yinna bata yelin tiyɛ, e yi Ala tantun bɛti ba kariɲanne nun kondenne nun bɔlɔnne ra. <verse eid="NEH 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28"/>Bɛti baane yi e malan keli Netofa banxidɛne ra Yerusalɛn rabilinna nun <verse eid="NEH 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29"/>Beti-Giligali taan nun Geba nun Asamawɛti yamanane yi. Bɛti baane bata yi taane ti Yerusalɛn rabilinni. <verse eid="NEH 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30"/>Saraxaraline nun Lewine yi e yɛtɛ rasariɲan, e yamaan fan nasariɲan, e nun taan dɛɛne nun a yinna.<verse eid="NEH 12:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31"/>N yi yamarin fi a Yuda kuntigine xa te yinna xuntagi. N yi bɛti baane yitaxun firinna ra. A singen yi siga yiifanna ma yinna xuntagi Xuruse Ɲɛɲɛ Dɛɛn binni. <verse eid="NEH 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32"/>Hosaya nun Yuda kuntigine fɔxɔ kedenna biraxi e fɔxɔ ra, <verse eid="NEH 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33"/>e nun Asari nun Esirasi nun Mesulan nun <verse eid="NEH 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34"/>Yuda nun Bunyamin nun Semaya nun Yeremi <verse eid="NEH 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35"/>e nun saraxaraline diine, xɔtaan yi naxanye yii e nun Yonatan ma diin Sakari. Semaya nan Yonatan sɔtɔ. Matani nan Semaya sɔtɔ. Mikahu nan Matani sɔtɔ. Sakuru nan Mikahu sɔtɔ. Asafi nan Sakuru sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NEH 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36"/>A ngaxakedenne fan yi a fɔxɔ ra: Semaya nun Asarɛli nun Milalayi nun Gilalayi nun Maayi nun Natanɛli nun Yuda nun Xanani. Dawuda, Alaa muxuna bɛti ba seene yi e yii. Sɛbɛli tiina Esirasi nan yi tixi e yɛɛ ra. <verse eid="NEH 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37"/>E to Tigi Dɛɛn li, e yi te Dawudaa Taan kiraan xɔn, te yinna xuntagi, Dawudaa banxin xun ma, siga han Ige Dɛna sogeteden binni.<verse eid="NEH 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38"/>Bɛti baane dɔxɔden firinden yi siga kɔmɛnna ma. Nxu nun yama dɔnxɛn yi bira e fɔxɔ ra yinna xuntagi. Nxu yi dangu Buru Ganden Sangansoon na siga han yinna yigbo yirena, <verse eid="NEH 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39"/>han Efirami Dɛɛn xanbi ra, siga han Dɛ Fonna, dangu Yɛxɛ Dɛɛn na, han Xananɛli Sangansona e nun sangansoon naxan xili Kɛmɛ han Yɛxɛɛne So Dɛna. E yi ti Kantan Ti Dɛɛn na.<verse eid="NEH 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40"/>Na xanbi ra, bɛti ba dɔxɔ firinne yi ti Ala Batu Banxini. Nxu nun kuntigine yi ti naxanye yi n fɔxɔ ra, e nun <verse eid="NEH 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41"/>saraxaraline: Eliyakimi nun Maaseya nun Miniyamin nun Mikahu nun Eliyowenayi nun Sakari nun Xananiya. E xɔtane suxi e yii. <verse eid="NEH 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42"/>Maaseya nun Semaya nun Eleyasari nun Yusi nun Yehoxanan nun Malakiya nun Elan nun Eseri fan yi na. Yesiraxiya nan yi bɛti baane yɛɛratiin na. <verse eid="NEH 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43"/>Muxune yi saraxa wuyaxi ba na lɔxɔni, e sɛwa, bayo Ala bata yi sɛwa fe gbeen nagidi e ma. Ɲaxanle nun diidine fan yi sɛwa, Yerusalɛn sɛwa xuiin yi mɛma yire makuyeni.<verse eid="NEH 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44"/>Na lɔxɔni, e yi muxune dɔxɔ se ramaradene xunna bogise singene nun yaganne yi ramarama dɛnaxanye yi. E yi e ti ne malanna ra, yamanan taane birin yi, naxan lanma a so saraxaraline nun Lewine yii Ala kiseen na. Yuda kaane yi sɛwaxi bayo saraxaraline nun Lewine birin yi e wanla ra. <verse eid="NEH 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45"/>E lu Alaa wanla kɛ, e nun marasariɲan wanla, e nun bɛti baane nun kantan tiine alo Dawuda nun a dii xɛmɛn Sulemani a yamari kii naxan yi. <verse eid="NEH 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46"/>Bayo waxati danguxini, Dawuda nun Asafi waxatini, bɛti ba kuntigine yi na e nun bɛtine Ala tantun xinla ma. <verse eid="NEH 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47"/>Sorobabeli nun Neyemi waxatini, Isirayila kaane birin yi seene soma nɛn bɛti baane nun kantan tiine yii alo a yi lan kii naxan yi lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ. E yi e yagan sariɲanxine soma nɛn Lewine yii, Lewine fan yi nde so Haruna yixɛtɛne yii.<verse eid="NEH 12:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13"/>
  <para style="s">Neyemi kɛwali dɔnxɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1"/>Na waxatini, e yi Musaa sariya kɛdin xaran yamaan xa, e yi a to sɛbɛxi fa fala, Amonine nun Moyaba kaane mi lan e so Alaa yamani mumɛ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.1</char> Na feen sɛbɛxi Sariyane 23.4-6 kui.</note> <verse eid="NEH 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2"/>amasɔtɔ waxati danguxini, e mi Isirayila kaane yisuxu, e mi donseen nun igen so e yii, e yɛtɛɛn yi Balami saren fi alogo a xa e danga. Koni, en ma Ala yi dangan maxɛtɛ duban na.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.2</char> Na feen sɛbɛxi Yatɛne 22.1-6 kui.</note> <verse eid="NEH 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3"/>Yamaan to sariya kɛdin xaran xuiin namɛ, e yi xɔɲɛne birin kedi Isirayila kaane yɛ.<verse eid="NEH 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4"/>Benun na xa liga, saraxaralina Eliyasibi naxan yi walima en ma Ala Batu Banxin se ramaradene yi, naxan mɔn yi findixi Tobiya ngaxakedenna ra, <verse eid="NEH 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5"/>na bata yi banxin kuiin yire belebelena nde yitɔn Tobiya xa, bogise saraxane nun wusulanna nun goronne yi ramaraxi dɛnaxan yi nun, e nun murutun yaganna nun manpaan nun turena, naxan yi findixi Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune gbeen na, e nun bɛti baane nun kantan tiine nun saraxaraline.<verse eid="NEH 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6"/>N mi yi Yerusalɛn yi na waxatini na feene ligɛ, amasɔtɔ n bata yi xɛtɛ Babilɔn mangana Aratasɛrɛkɛsi fɛma, a mangayaan ɲɛɛ tonge saxan e nun firinden ma. Na xanbi ra, n yi mangan maxɔdin, a yi tin n xa siga, <verse eid="NEH 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7"/>n yi xɛtɛ Yerusalɛn yi. N yi fe ɲaxin to Eliyasibi naxan naba, a to palana nde so Tobiya yii Alaa banxin yinna kui. <verse eid="NEH 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8"/>Na yi n xɔlɔ ki faɲi. N yi Tobiya yiiseene birin namini palaan fari ma. <verse eid="NEH 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9"/>N yi yamarin fi a e xa palane rasariɲan, n mɔn yi Ala Batu Banxin seene dɔxɔ e funfune yi, e nun bogise saraxane nun wusulanne.<verse eid="NEH 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10"/>N mɔn yi a mɛ a Lewine mi e gbee saraxane sɔtɔxi, n mɔn yi a mɛ fa fala Lewine nun bɛti baan naxanye yi walima Ala Batu Banxini, ne bata xɛtɛ e xɛɛne ma. <verse eid="NEH 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11"/>N yi kuntigine maxadi, n naxa, “Nanfera Ala Batu Banxin bata rabeɲin?” N yi Lewine nun bɛti baane malan, n yi birin ti a funfuni. <verse eid="NEH 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12"/>Nayi, Yuda kaane birin yi fa yaganna nun murutun nun turen na se ramaradeni. <verse eid="NEH 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13"/>N yi se ramaraden taxu saraxaraliin Selemiya nun sɛbɛli tiin Sadɔki nun Lewina nde ra naxan xili Pɛdaya. N yi Sakuru a diin Xanan findi e mali muxun na, Matani mamandenna, bayo birin yi laxi e ra. E tan nan yi sɔlɔnni taxunma e ngaxakedenne ma.<verse eid="NEH 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14"/>N ma Ala, n ma fe xa rabira i ma, na ma, n naxan nabaxi lannayani n ma Alaa banxin xa alogo i xa batu. I nama i mɛ n na.<verse eid="NEH 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15"/>N muxune to na waxatin nin sali lɔxɔni Yuda yamanani, e manpa bogine yibutuxunma. Nde yi bogise xidine rasoma, e xidixi sofanle fari, e nun wudi bogi igen nun manpa bogine nun xɔdɛne nun goronna sifan birin, siga Yerusalɛn yi Matabu Lɔxɔni. N yi a fala e xa a e nama fa donseene mati na lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NEH 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16"/>Tire kaane fan yi dɔxi mɛnni, naxanye fan yi fama yɛxɛn nun sare seen sifan birin na, e yi e mati Yuda kaane ma Yerusalɛn yi sali lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NEH 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17"/>N mɔn yi Yuda fonne maxadi, n naxa, “Fe ɲaxini ito bunna nanse ra, ɛ yi Matabu Lɔxɔn naxɔsi? <verse eid="NEH 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18"/>Ɛ benbane fan mi ito xan liga ba? Ala bata fe ɲaxini itoe birin nafa en nun taani ito ma. Ɛ tan mɔn a xɔlɔn fari sama Isirayila xili ma, ɛ yi Matabu Lɔxɔn sariɲanna kala.”<verse eid="NEH 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19"/>Na xanbi ra, benun Matabu Lɔxɔn xa a li, dimin nɛma Yerusalɛn dɛɛne li tun, n yi yamarin fi, a dɛɛne xa ragali, e nama fa rabi fɔ Matabu Lɔxɔn na dangu. N yi n ma walikɛna ndee dɔxɔ dɛɛne ra, alogo muxune nama so goronne ra Matabu Lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NEH 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20"/>Na ma, sare matine nun sare soone yi kɔɛɛn nadangu Yerusalɛn fari ma sanɲa ma keden hanma sanɲa ma firin. <verse eid="NEH 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21"/>N yi e rakolon, n naxa, “Nanfera ɛ kɔɛɛn nadanguma yinna fari ma? Xa ɛ mɔn a liga, n na ɛ suxuma nɛn.” Xabu na lɔxɔni, e mi fa fa Matabu Lɔxɔni sɔnɔn. <verse eid="NEH 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22"/>N mɔn yi yamarin fi Lewine ma a e xa e rasariɲan, e fa dɛɛne kantan alogo e xa Matabu Lɔxɔn findi lɔxɔ sariɲanxin na.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Na feen ma, n ma fe xa rabira i ma, n ma Ala, i yi n kantan i ya hinan gbeeni.<verse eid="NEH 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23"/>Na waxatini, Yuda kaana ndee bata yi ɲaxanle dɔxɔ naxanye yi kelixi Asadodi nun Amoni nun Moyaba siyane yɛ. <verse eid="NEH 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24"/>E diine fɔxɔ kedenna yi Asadodi xuiin falama ba xui gbɛtɛye ra, koni e mi yi nɔɛ Heburu xuiin falɛ. <verse eid="NEH 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25"/>N yi e maxadi, n yi e danga, n yi ndee bɔnbɔ, n yi e xunsɛxɛne matala, n yi e rakɔlɔ Ala yi, n naxa, “Ɛ nama ɛ dii tɛmɛne so siya gbɛtɛne yii e ɲaxanle ra, ɛ nama siya gbɛtɛne dii tɛmɛne tongo ɛ nun ɛ dii xɛmɛne xa. <verse eid="NEH 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26"/>Isirayila mangan Sulemani mi yulubin liga na kiin xan yi ba? A ɲɔxɔn manga mi yi na siyane yɛ, a yi rafan a Ala ma. Ala bata yi a findi mangan na Isirayila birin xun na. Koni hali na, siya gbɛtɛne ɲaxanle a ti nɛn yulubin ma. <verse eid="NEH 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27"/>Nxu fa a mɛ iki fa fala a ɛ fe ɲaxi sifani ito ligama, fe ɲaxi gbeena en ma Ala ra, ɛ yi siya gbɛtɛ ɲaxanle dɔxɔ.”<verse eid="NEH 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28"/>Yehoyadaa dii xɛmɛna nde, saraxarali kuntigina Eliyasibi mamandenna yi findixi Horoni kaan Sanbalata bitanna nan na. N yi a kedi n yɛtagi. <verse eid="NEH 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29"/>E fe xa rabira i ma, n ma Ala, bayo e bata saraxarali wanla sariɲanna kala, e nun saraxaraline nun Lewine layirina.<verse eid="NEH 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30"/>N na e birin nasariɲan nɛn xɔɲɛne seene birin ma, n mɔn yi saraxaraline nun Lewine ti e wanle ra. <verse eid="NEH 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31"/>N mɔn na liga nɛn saraxa yegene ra waxati saxini, e nun bogise singene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">N ma Ala, n ma fe xa rabira i ma, i fan n na.<verse eid="NEH 13:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13"/>
</usx>
